// A forest sprite that staffs a building of its job, or mines. Out of a
// building, an enemy's swings hurt it: three hits kill it, and it comes
// back beside the tree 900 frames (15 s) later, keeping its job
// (SACRED_TREE_BALLISTA.md, B6). A miner digs a layer in 540 frames (9 s,
// 4.5 times the elder's 2 s; SACRED_TREE_MINING.md, M9) and carries up to
// 6 stone, a dig's most, a unit every 20 frames. Drawn by the worker skin
// until it has its own.
(
    sim: (
        brain: Sprite,
        body: (radius: 0.22),
        movement: (walk: 1.6),
        sprite: (health: 3, respawn: 900, mine: (dig: 540, capacity: 6, transfer: 20)),
    ),
    view: (skin: "worker"),
)
